Folio CJK font pack
===================

Droid Sans Fallback: a font with Chinese, Japanese and Korean characters,
for PDFs and ebooks whose text in those languages doesn't carry its own
font (Apache License 2.0, The Android Open Source Project; FontLicence).

To install: drag the !Folio in this zip over your own !Folio. The Filer
puts the font in !Folio.Fonts, where Folio finds it the next time it
starts. (If you have PackMan's FontConfig installed, Folio uses its fonts
as well as these.)
